## Maintenance Rules

- Add named technologies only when they materially shape the architecture.
- Assign stable TECH IDs and never reuse retired IDs.
- Record replacement and coexistence explicitly.
- Keep unknown versions, owners, regions, and lifecycle dates visible.
- Review the inventory whenever an ADR introduces, replaces, or retires technology.
